    "updated_at": "2023-10-14T11:56:28Z",
    "body": "Hey @aayushii9602 \r\n\r\nThanks for your submission. I read the blog. Most of the content is incorrect. I can accept the PR once you solve these issues:\r\n\r\n1. `akto test my_crlf_injection_test.rb` there is no such command to run test in Akto. Did you actually run the test?\r\n2. `Akto uses a simple yet powerful DSL (Domain Specific Language)` - Akto doesn't use DSL \r\n3. The test case example you have provided is wrong and not sure where it's taken from. Did you login to akto and see how akto tests are written and run?\r\n4. Setting up Akto instructions are wrong. Did you try to setup akto by yourself?\r\n\r\nPlease read the requirements above. I will be able to accept PR once the blog is factually correct. Let me know if you want help. Please make sure you have actually used the product before you write the blog. Incorrect blogs won't be accepted.\r\n\r\nI am happy to help. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
